ition":0,"left":78,"right":78},{"type":"CONTEXT","blobLineNumber":79,"text":" output tok/s`.","html":" output tok/s`.","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":1,"left":79,"right":79},{"type":"CONTEXT","blobLineNumber":80,"text":" ","html":"\u003cbr\u003e","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":2,"left":80,"right":80},{"type":"CONTEXT","blobLineNumber":81,"text":" The current host is running the cards over PCIe4 x16. A PCIe5 x16 path has about","html":" The current host is running the cards over PCIe4 x16. A PCIe5 x16 path has about","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":3,"left":81,"right":81},{"type":"DELETION","blobLineNumber":82,"text":"-twice the raw signaling rate. Our XCCL allreduce check matched that simple","html":"-twice the raw signaling rate. Our XCCL allreduce check matched that simple","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":4,"left":82,"right":81},{"type":"DELETION","blobLineNumber":83,"text":"-math: the older reference was `27.88 GB/s`, while this host measured","html":"-math: the older reference was \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e27.88 GB/s\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e, while this host measured","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":5,"left":83,"right":81},{"type":"DELETION","blobLineNumber":84,"text":"-`13.79 GB/s`, almost exactly half. MiniMax TP4 decode communicates across GPUs","html":"-\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e13.79 GB/s\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e, almost exactly half. MiniMax TP4 decode communicates across GPUs","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":6,"left":84,"right":81},{"type":"DELETION","blobLineNumber":85,"text":"-often, so that is a plausible reason for most of the gap without changing model","html":"-often, so that is a plausible reason for most of the gap without changing model","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":7,"left":85,"right":81},{"type":"DELETION","blobLineNumber":86,"text":"-quality.","html":"-quality.","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":8,"left":86,"right":81},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":82,"text":"+twice the encoding capacity. A cross-host XCCL observation measured `27.88","html":"+twice the encoding capacity. A cross-host XCCL observation measured `27.88","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":9,"left":86,"right":82},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":83,"text":"+GB/s` on the older reference and `13.79 GB/s` here, while the closer MiniMax","html":"+GB/s\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e on the older reference and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e13.79 GB/s` here, while the closer MiniMax","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":10,"left":86,"right":83},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":84,"text":"+TP4 decode comparison changed much less, from `89.314` to `83.17-83.79 output","html":"+TP4 decode comparison changed much less, from \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003e89.314\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e`\u003c/span\u003e to `83.17-83.79 output","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":11,"left":86,"right":84},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":85,"text":"+tok/s`. That makes fabric bandwidth a plausible contributor, not a proven","html":"+tok/s`. That makes fabric bandwidth a plausible contributor, not a proven","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":12,"left":86,"right":85},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":86,"text":"+one-variable cause.","html":"+one-variable cause.","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":13,"left":86,"right":86},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":87,"text":"+","html":"+","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":14,"left":86,"right":87},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":88,"text":"+A later controlled Qwen TP2 experiment reduced the same selected B70 links","html":"+A later controlled Qwen TP2 experiment reduced the same selected B70 links","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":15,"left":86,"right":88},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":89,"text":"+from Gen4 x16 to Gen3 x16. Its bulk all-reduce slowed by 21.2%, but c1 and c12","html":"+from Gen4 x16 to Gen3 x16. Its bulk all-reduce slowed by 21.2%, but c1 and c12","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":16,"left":86,"right":89},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":90,"text":"+decode stayed inside the Gen4 control envelope. PCIe sensitivity is therefore","html":"+decode stayed inside the Gen4 control envelope. PCIe sensitivity is therefore","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":17,"left":86,"right":90},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":91,"text":"+workload- and topology-dependent; a 2x link-rate change does not imply a 2x","html":"+workload- and topology-dependent; a 2x link-rate change does not imply a 2x","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":18,"left":86,"right":91},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":92,"text":"+token-rate change. See the","html":"+token-rate change. See the","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":19,"left":86,"right":92},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":93,"text":"+[PCIe topology and local-LLM inference guide](pcie-topology-and-llm-inference.md)","html":"+\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003ePCIe topology and local-LLM inference guide\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-corl\"\u003epcie-topology-and-llm-inference.md\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":20,"left":86,"right":93},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNumber":94,"text":"+for Gen3 boards, Thunderbolt, x1 risers, topology inspection, and a safe","html":"+for Gen3 boards, Thunderbolt, x1 risers, topology inspection, and a safe","displayNoNewLineWarning":false,"position":21,"left":86,"right":94},{"type":"ADDITION","blobLineNu